Today is Tuesday.
It is the month of February.
It is half past five in the evening.
I go to my gym.
I always come here on Tuesday and Thursday.
I go inside the gym.
The trainer didi is there.
I say hello to her.
She asks, "Maya, at what time do you come on Thursday?"
I say, "I always come at half past five."
I start my exercise.
Sometimes I ride a bicycle.
But in the gym I lift weights.
I drink a lot of water every day.
I exercise for one hour.
Now it is half past six.
My exercise is complete.
After the workout I feel light.
Now I have a good routine.
I always follow it.
